{"id":"H1283","lemma":"בְּרִיעָה","transliteration":"beriah","sayIt":"be-ri-AH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Beriah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.17;\nson of: Asher (H0836);\nbrother of: Imnah (H3232), Ishvah (H3438), Ishvi (H3440) and Serah (H8294);\nfather of: Heber (H2268) and Malchiel (H4439); also called Beriite at Num.26.44;\nAlso named: be.ri.i (בְּרִיעִי \"Beriite\" H1284)\n§ Beriah = \"with a friend\"\n1) a son of Asher\n2) a son of Ephraim\n3) a Benjamite\n4) a Levite","glosses":["beriah"],"count":10,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Beriah","kjv":"and Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":44,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Beriah","kjv":"of Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":45,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Beriah","kjv":"of Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Beriah","kjv":"Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Beriah","kjv":"and Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Beriah","kjv":"of Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Beriah","kjv":"Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Beriah","kjv":"of Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Beriah","kjv":"and Beriah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Beriah","kjv":"and Beriah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 46:17","note":"The sons of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, and Serah their sister. The sons of Beriah: Heber and Malchiel.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 26:44","note":"The sons of Asher after their families: of Imnah, the family of the Imnites; of Ishvi, the family of the Ishvites; of Beriah, the family of the Berites.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:23","note":"He went in to his wife, and she conceived, and bore a son, and he named him Beriah, because there was trouble with his house.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":